From: tao3k team and Contributors
Subject: Native module frontier, worker readiness and failure propagation

Read source identity without expanding ordinary or explicit-header bodies.
Use declaration hints only for ordering; actual expanded imports own dependency
eligibility. Ready native workers before source coordinators and reuse native
barrier error handling for both. Preserve the first arbitrary Scheme failure,
including #f, independently from its presence. Keep all targets and capacity.

